Checkout screen: lib/screens/product_checkout_screen.dart\par
Razorpay checkout callbacks: lib/provider/razorpayprovider.dart\par
Order and payment requests: lib/provider/orderditiyalce.dart\par
Messaging requests: lib/provider/messageprovider.dart\par
Razorpay Edge Function: supabase/functions/supabase-razorpay/index.ts\par
Messaging Edge Function: supabase/functions/messaging/index.ts\par
Database schema and RPCs: supabase_schema.sql\par
\par
\i These notes describe the project structure and behavior observed in the repository. Verify deployment settings and database configuration in the Supabase Dashboard before testing live services.\i0\par
